WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:11.845
&gt;&gt;&gt; WELL, I HAVE THE FIRST GOOD
NEWS IN WEEKS.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:15.648
THE INFECTION STOPPED SPREADING,
YOU'RE GOING TO MAKE A FULL

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
RECOVERY.
WE ALMOST LOST YOU CHAD.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:22.756
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
&gt;&gt; I HAVE TO SAY, I AM GOING TO

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:32.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
MISS YOU, CHAD.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:40.807
&gt;&gt; AND I'VE --JUST SAY IT THEN,
I THINK I HAVE FALLEN IN LOVE

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
WITH YOU, CHAD.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.414
&gt;&gt; YOU MUST HAVE A MILLION
THOUGHTS RACING THROUGH YOUR

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:52.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
MIND.
YOU ARE DRIVING ME CRAZY.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.854
EVERY TIME I LOOK AT YOU, I JUST
WANT TO CLIMB IN THAT BED AND

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:59.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
MAKE SWEET LOVE TO YOU.
&gt;&gt; NICE.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:04.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BUT WE CAN'T.
&gt;&gt; OH, OKAY.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:10.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'M YOUR DOCTOR FOR GOD
SAKES.

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
BUT I MUST CONFESS, I HAVE

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.640
FANTASIZED ABOUT LAYING ON YOUR
CHEST WHILE YOU PLAY WITH MY

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:21.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
HAIR, TALKING ABOUT OUR LIVES,
OUR HOPES, OUR DREAMS --

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:28.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I PEED.
&gt;&gt; I UNDERSTAND IF YOU THINK

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:31.124
THAT MY ARGUMENT LACKS VALIDITY.
&gt;&gt; HA HA.

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
TITTY.
&gt;&gt; IT COULD NEVER HAPPEN.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:40.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
I WOULD BE FIRED FOR BECOMING
INVOLVED WITH A PATIENT.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.268
IS IT CRAZY I WOULD BE WILLING
TO RISK MY ENTIRE CAREER TO BE

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:58.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
WITH YOU, CHAD?
CHAD?

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.053
CHAD, COULD YOU PLEASE COME BACK
HERE FOR A MOMENT?

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, OKAY.
&gt;&gt; I'M A DOCTOR.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:12.465
I LISTEN TO HEARTS EVERY DAY.
IT'S TIME I LISTEN TO MY OWN.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:23.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
IT WANTS YOU, CHAD.
OH GOD, IT'S RACING RIGHT NOW.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.245
&gt;&gt; YO IS THAT A ZIT OR A HERPE?
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT IS A LITTLE

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
INGROWN HAIR.
&gt;&gt; DOPE.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NOW GET SOME SLEEP, YOUNG
MAN.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:38.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND DREAM ABOUT ME.
DOCTOR'S ORDERS.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:45.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
&gt;&gt; AND CHAD --

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:51.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ KNOCKING ]
YOU KNOW, I NEVER ASKED HOW HE

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
GOT SICK?
&gt;&gt; OH, HIS FRIEND DARED HIM TO

00:02:53.439 --> 00:03:04.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
